WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Hello Everybody!

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:03.800
My name is Markiplier and welcome back to Resident Evil 7.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.740
If you thought the evil ended there,

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:09.400
there's so much more to this story that you need to learn about,

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:14.620
and it's all contained in banned footage from the Baker Family Farm

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.880
So! And there's also other--

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:17.380
I don't know,

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.020
Silly? Kinda games?

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.600
That are 'Ethan Must Die' and then 'Jack's 55th Birthday' Party

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.140
Which is like..

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:25.780
'It's Jack's birthday, but he's not interested in presents.'

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.000
'It's food he wants,'

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.640
'So find some for him as fast as you can!'

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.120
And that sounds disgusting!

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:34.980
So I'm gonna go with the "Banned Footage" first

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.800
I may not be able to get through all of this in just one go

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.400
but, I'm gonna see what it is

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.100
Reporter: "Many residents, in so--"

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:41.900
*sound cuts off*

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:42.860
(Incoming Spoop Collage)

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.400
"Why are you doing this--?!"
(Grunting)

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.040
(Eveline laughs)
(The lighter flicks on)

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:47.920
(Heavy breathing)

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.580
"Look at all the pretties my little girl has given me!"

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:52.680
Ewww

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:56.480
That's not a good gift, ma-ma

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:57.660
Okay,

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.460
So this is all of the Banned Footage

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:02.040
Those are like 'extra' games to play

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.460
But this is legitimate to the story, as far as I know.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:07.520
So! Where do I start?

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:08.700
Do I start from Nightmare?

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:10.340
Do I start from Bedroom?

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.540
Do I start from 21?

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:12.520
Do I start from.....

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:14.820
Daughters?

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:17.600
*reads* "Experience the beginning 
of the Bakers' tragic story"

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.220
Now, there's two volumes to this

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.280
and I don't know if there is a correct order to go in

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.020
in relation to the two volumes.

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.460
They were both released on PC

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:25.600
where I had my save game

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:26.140
at the same time.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:27.840
So since this says 'The Beginning'

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:29.940
I'm gonna go with this one.

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.360
*Stutters*

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:34.340
You know with my luck I'm probably going about it backwards,

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:37.500
Which is how I've done pretty much everything in my games

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.700
(reading screen) three years ago the baker were like any other family

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.700
They had just finished a family dinner

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:45.960
Listening to the rain drops hammering against the window panes as they ate

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:48.100
A moment of peace and quiet

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:50.860
Their last for some time

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:52.940
And so we begin..

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.500
'Daughters- Last night Spent with my Real Family'

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:59.320
Again, I don't know who recorded this.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:00.360
Oh!...ok..

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.180
(Derp)

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:04.940
Hello! (Laughing)

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:09.700
Great!

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:11.800
Cool!

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:20.820
So people were searching for the ship

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:37.660
Oh, Jesus!

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:39.720
I thought I was just watching a news story for there..

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:42.200
Huh.

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:44.460
So who am I playing as?

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:49.260
Who am I?

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:50.980
Wait, who am I?

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.820
I can barely remember the names of 'em.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:55.300
Am I the daughter?

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:57.220
I'm.. pretty sure I'd be the daughter then.

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:27.620
*Chuckle*

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.000
This is so weird..

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:38.920
So weird..!

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.040
They look so normal!

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:43.240
Everything's so normal!

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.540
He's just messing on his phone!

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:48.880
I.. I ju--

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:51.960
