00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:58.640
Alright, I'll get it Marguerite!

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.900
MOM, I-I mean

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:01.900
Cause I'm Zoe

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.260
