00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.000
Good night for soup indeed,

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.000
(Mark takes it all in)

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:10.380
God! I need to wrap my head around this.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.600
Also, I wanted to mention that some people pointed out

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:17.180
this might actually be before the zombie outbreak in Raccoon City.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:20.740
Uh, I-I don't remember if there was an official source that said that,

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.760
but I might be willing to believe that too.

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:27.020
So... But either way, what I meant was, like, this is a good launching point

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.120
for the rest of the series. Because, this just opens up so many

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.840
more possiblities for Resident Evil.

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:34.880
If they're starting over, I applaud them.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.560
Because this is the best way to start over.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:39.000
I love this game.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:40.760
I still love this game.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.500
